      "value": "wait I may have misunderstood. if this is specifically for ARM then the one I linked may actually be different. It would be nice for an ARM build, though currently I think native linux may be the more useful of the two as far as userbase.\n\nThe steam frame sounds impressive, but I'm scheptical how well even a native ARM vrchat app would run on it. It may just be better to run on a pc, windows or linux, and stream it to the headset",
